**console.hpp defines console matching, variadic logging, and `GIT_VERSION` fallback.**

## API

`match_compare(std::string,const std::string&,bool)->bool`; `print(int,const char*,...)->void`; `console_type`: `con_type_error=1`, `con_type_debug=2`, `con_type_warning=3`, `con_type_info=7`.

`error`, `debug`, `warn`, `info(const char*,Args&&...)->void` forward to `print`; `debug` requires `DEBUG`. `GIT_VERSION` defaults to `"unknown"`.